<li>International Political Economy: Conflict and Cooperation in the Global System (co-authored with Frederic S. Pearson) (1999; Chinese translation, Peking University Press, 2006)</li>
<li>U.S. Foreign Economic and Military Aid: The Reagan and Bush Administrations (1996).</li>
<li>He has co-edited (with Richard G. Hovannisian) two volumes, Armenian Constantinople (2010) and Armenian Cilicia (2008).</li>
